01:54.239 --> 01:57.114
JUNE - THE LAND OF DREAMS

01:57.405 --> 02:03.530
SCHOOL OF PERFORMING ARTS   STUDENT DORMS

01:57.697 --> 01:59.739
It's been three months since we met,

01:59.739 --> 02:03.364
and the Cos-Prayers girls and I have
gotten to know each other well.

02:03.530 --> 02:06.197
But, Yagami, the one most important to me...

02:06.197 --> 02:09.489
has been so busy that I've
made no progress with her at all.

02:11.905 --> 02:15.864
God damn that little dwarf woman!

02:16.280 --> 02:18.780
What the hell is with these story revisions?!

02:19.905 --> 02:22.280
I'll kill her!

02:22.989 --> 02:25.155
But...

02:27.114 --> 02:29.239
In the end, I didn't finish.

02:30.655 --> 02:31.364
Yagami.

02:41.572 --> 02:42.280
Boing.

02:43.072 --> 02:46.072
This feels... exactly like Katsuragi!

02:47.364 --> 02:53.655
Hold on, I've heard they have padded bras
these days that give a realistic feel, too.

03:01.322 --> 03:04.197
Sorry, Yagami! I couldn't help it!

03:08.364 --> 03:12.114
Never mind progress, that was a major setback!

03:12.114 --> 03:13.614
Ooizumi?

03:15.739 --> 03:18.989
The truth is, something's bothering me.

03:18.989 --> 03:22.364
And you're the only one I can turn to!

03:22.905 --> 03:25.614
I want to meet you during afternoon break.

03:25.614 --> 03:28.572
I'll be waiting at the bench under the tree.

03:31.114 --> 03:33.155
I'm the only one?

03:33.405 --> 03:35.239
"In the reign of a certain emperor,

03:35.239 --> 03:38.822
among the many noble ladies
and attendants of the court,

03:38.822 --> 03:41.364
there was one of unexceptional rank...

03:41.364 --> 03:44.072
who enjoyed exceptional favor."

03:45.197 --> 03:48.239
In modern Japanese, that would read...

03:50.405 --> 03:53.739
God, she's so adorable!

03:53.739 --> 03:59.197
Hang on, Yagami! I'll just fix up episodes
3 and 4 in time for afternoon break!

04:03.905 --> 04:06.322
It's no use! I can't think of anything!

04:11.655 --> 04:15.739
I'm sorry! I need a little time!
Just wait for me a little while!

04:20.905 --> 04:24.155
This is the place for me to get the ideas flowing!

04:24.155 --> 04:25.822
It always does!

04:25.822 --> 04:27.030
There we go...

04:34.114 --> 04:35.530
K-Katsuragi!

04:37.614 --> 04:39.905
She's coordinated...

04:39.905 --> 04:41.780
No way! Stop!

04:54.739 --> 04:56.322
I... I'm sorry!

04:56.572 --> 04:59.822
Oh, no problem... I'm fine...

05:00.405 --> 05:04.155
Do... Do you come here often, Ooizumi?

05:04.155 --> 05:06.322
Huh? Oh, yeah.

05:06.697 --> 05:10.905
Me, too. I love the wide view of
the sky and the breeze here.

05:12.114 --> 05:16.322
How do I look, from your point of view?

05:16.322 --> 05:18.572
H-how do you look?

05:18.572 --> 05:23.280
Well, you know. What feeling
do you get from me?

05:25.155 --> 05:27.739
Feeling? As in the Squishy-squishy thing?

05:28.239 --> 05:31.280
How do I compare to Yagami?

05:31.489 --> 05:34.322
How?! Well, you beat her in the size department.

05:34.322 --> 05:38.239
But Yagami's are softer, like touching an angel.

05:38.239 --> 05:41.197
On the other hand, yours are firmer...

05:42.030 --> 05:43.739
As an actress.

05:43.739 --> 05:45.864
THAT'S what she meant?!

05:45.864 --> 05:47.239
Well?

05:47.239 --> 05:50.530
I... I think you're good. Both of you are.

05:50.989 --> 05:52.947
Thank you!

05:55.739 --> 06:00.197
If that's true, then I'm so glad.

06:00.197 --> 06:03.947
When I heard they were suddenly
rewriting the scripts,

06:03.947 --> 06:09.822
I was worried my performance was bad
and that I was being cut.

06:09.947 --> 06:12.114
Th-that's not it at all!

06:12.114 --> 06:17.822
I've never seen a heroine on an
action team that looked so committed.

06:17.989 --> 06:19.822
Really?!

06:19.989 --> 06:22.572
Oh, sorry about that.

06:22.780 --> 06:26.947
Ooizumi, are you still doing the making-of video?

06:26.947 --> 06:29.239
As long as you don't tell me to cut it out.

06:29.239 --> 06:31.114
Keep making it! Promise me!

06:31.114 --> 06:33.280
Huh? Oh, of course I will.

06:35.572 --> 06:38.905
Being an actress is about shining
as brightly as you can.

06:40.239 --> 06:42.655
And you do it all the more for someone you love.

06:47.447 --> 06:50.114
Am I on "Did I Hear That Right?" Hour?

06:50.114 --> 06:53.197
I don't have time to be thinking about this stuff!

06:54.489 --> 06:57.197
Agh! Episodes 3 and 4 can wait!

06:57.822 --> 07:00.072
Wait! This way should be faster!

07:00.447 --> 07:01.864
Okay!

07:02.655 --> 07:04.739
I'll just cut through here, and...

07:05.405 --> 07:09.280
Is this...? Don't tell me...!

07:09.739 --> 07:11.530
Ooizumi!

07:13.405 --> 07:15.947
What's got you looking
so bent out of shape, kid?

07:16.072 --> 07:19.780
"Kid"?! Imamura, I'm older than you!

07:19.780 --> 07:24.280
You wanna be doing that?

07:19.781 --> 07:24.280
What if I screamed right now?

07:24.655 --> 07:25.989
Then, this is...!

07:29.614 --> 07:30.447
Follow me!

07:39.780 --> 07:42.405
According to my adult horoscope,

07:42.405 --> 07:46.864
something will happen today
with you and the girl of your destiny.

07:46.864 --> 07:50.614
I don't care! Won't somebody
do something about this?!

07:50.614 --> 07:52.947
Oh, you're looking at it again!

07:53.280 --> 07:55.780
You've been looking at that a lot lately, Miku.

07:55.780 --> 07:57.780
N-no, I haven't...

07:57.780 --> 07:59.614
You must like him!

07:59.614 --> 08:02.572
Really? The guy with the Big Brother vibe?

08:04.489 --> 08:05.822
You need lucky panties!

08:05.822 --> 08:07.780
We'll all help you pick them out!

08:07.780 --> 08:10.364
I've already picked out a pair!

08:11.280 --> 08:13.864
Ooh! Ooizumi, you naughty boy!

08:14.197 --> 08:16.780
No, I'm not! I have no choice in this!

08:22.614 --> 08:25.280
Yagami, I'm sorry! I'm coming right now!

08:27.947 --> 08:29.697
Ow, ow, ow...

08:31.197 --> 08:33.072
Jougasaki.

08:33.072 --> 08:34.405
Ooizumi.

08:35.280 --> 08:38.989
It... It must be some kind of fate
that we met here like this.

08:38.989 --> 08:41.572
Sorry! I'm in a hurry! Talk to you later!

08:41.739 --> 08:43.864
Dammit! Afternoon break's almost over!

08:44.030 --> 08:45.655
Ooizumi!

08:48.072 --> 08:49.947
Sunshine Attack!

08:53.780 --> 08:55.780
Wh-what was that all about?!

08:55.780 --> 09:00.197
I'm sorry, but you're the one I need right now!

09:00.197 --> 09:03.572
Huh? Don't tell me you're into older guys.

09:03.780 --> 09:07.905
Look, do you remember
Super Lightning God Saizerion?

09:07.905 --> 09:08.655
Huh?

09:08.655 --> 09:11.405
It was a cult series that ran on TV Taiyou.

09:11.405 --> 09:14.114
Kurume from Houchiku Productions was on it.

09:14.114 --> 09:16.697
Huh? Yeah, I remember. What about it?

09:16.697 --> 09:22.280
What was the book that the
girl guest star had in episode 22?

09:22.280 --> 09:23.072
Book?

09:23.072 --> 09:25.614
You know, the one she was carrying.

09:25.614 --> 09:29.197
She read it when the bad guys had her trapped.

09:29.197 --> 09:32.280
For the life of me, I can't remember what it was.

09:32.780 --> 09:35.114
Oh! "Wakanashu"!

09:35.114 --> 09:37.655
It was Tousan Wakazaki's "Wakanashu".

09:37.655 --> 09:42.405
Oh, so that was it! Thank you so much!

09:42.447 --> 09:46.030
Of all things, that trivia about Zerion...

09:46.030 --> 09:48.280
It's been bugging me so much!

09:48.280 --> 09:51.030
Thank goodness! As your reward...

09:51.030 --> 09:53.364
Super Lightning God Saizerion!

09:53.697 --> 09:55.905
Gulp. No! No "gulp"!

09:57.030 --> 09:58.322
Well, time to go.

09:58.322 --> 09:59.364
Um, Miku!

09:59.364 --> 10:00.489
Yes?

10:00.489 --> 10:04.614
It's okay to be enthusiastic, but if
you're not careful, people will see...

10:04.947 --> 10:06.822
What? You mean this?

10:07.572 --> 10:10.780
No problem at all! I'm wearing bloomers!

10:10.864 --> 10:13.197
Like I said, show a little restraint!

10:15.072 --> 10:18.822
Girls flipping each other's skirts
is kind of a fad right now.

10:19.072 --> 10:19.739
Huh?

10:20.239 --> 10:21.530
Eek!

10:22.905 --> 10:24.530
Well, see you!

10:24.530 --> 10:26.864
Agh! Even more time lost!

10:30.072 --> 10:31.822
Missed her.

10:33.364 --> 10:37.072
What's the next class? Right. Phys Ed.

10:39.155 --> 10:42.864
Oh, this is bad! What do I say
when I see Yagami?

10:43.280 --> 10:45.322
Well, first off, I'll apologize.

10:47.489 --> 10:49.405
Oh, Ooizumi.

10:49.405 --> 10:53.322
Ah! Sorry! I was on my way, but...

10:53.322 --> 10:56.780
Stuff happened. Seriously,
it was a chain of accidents.

10:56.780 --> 10:58.697
Then come with me!

10:58.697 --> 11:00.739
Huh? Oh, no way!

11:01.905 --> 11:04.364
No one will disturb us here.

11:04.364 --> 11:05.947
Let's have some fun.

11:05.947 --> 11:07.905
Yagami...

11:07.905 --> 11:10.114
Stop it! You're dreaming again!

11:18.822 --> 11:20.947
No one will disturb us here.

11:20.947 --> 11:22.364
Huh?

11:22.364 --> 11:24.614
Can I ask your advice?

11:24.614 --> 11:27.739
What? I mean, what about?

11:28.197 --> 11:33.947
You know how they call me
"Miss Take 17", right?

11:35.905 --> 11:40.030
I try as hard as I can, but it's not working out...

11:40.864 --> 11:44.114
I'm doing all I can,
but I feel worse and worse.

11:44.114 --> 11:47.530
I give it all I can, and they still yell cut at me.

11:48.572 --> 11:49.655
Yagami...

11:49.655 --> 11:51.447
So...

11:52.655 --> 11:54.489
So, I...

12:06.030 --> 12:07.739
S-sorry...

12:09.072 --> 12:11.155
No! It's okay.

12:11.280 --> 12:12.572
Oh? Good-

12:12.572 --> 12:14.322
I...!

12:14.822 --> 12:19.572
I want you to encourage me.

12:20.155 --> 12:23.280
To tell me it'll be okay. To keep at it.

12:23.614 --> 12:26.197
Yagami... I...!

12:53.780 --> 12:59.114
Nozoku finder ki ga tsukeba

12:59.405 --> 13:02.322
Kimi bakari wo

13:02.322 --> 13:06.239
Oikaketeita ne

13:06.864 --> 13:09.697
Futari no jikan wa

13:09.697 --> 13:12.905
Sukoshizutsu kasanatte

13:13.739 --> 13:16.114
Kakusenai omoi wa

13:16.114 --> 13:19.905
Kakusanakute ii

13:20.739 --> 13:24.197
Tsuki to hoshi ga mukashi

13:24.197 --> 13:26.822
Yakusoku shita

13:27.572 --> 13:31.114
Bokura wa zutto musubareru

13:31.114 --> 13:34.822
Kimateta mitai

13:34.905 --> 13:38.155
Dare yori tsuyoku dare yori chikaku

13:38.155 --> 13:41.614
Sou sa ai suru tame ni koko ni ita

13:41.864 --> 13:45.197
Hitomi no oku ni kokoro no naka ni

13:45.197 --> 13:48.447
Mata yaketsukeru kimi

13:48.572 --> 13:51.905
Kaze ga fuitemo ame ni furetemo

13:52.114 --> 13:55.364
Sou sa soba ni iyou futari nara

13:55.489 --> 13:58.989
Kinou ga kitto ashita ga motto

13:58.989 --> 14:02.864
Taisetsu ni naru kara

14:08.822 --> 14:23.864
NEXT
EPISODE

14:10.030 --> 14:12.322
I'm not always going to be the girl I was!

14:14.655 --> 14:17.364
I'm so happy!

14:18.030 --> 14:21.530
I'd like you to call me Natsumi.
